      "snippet": {
        "line": 283,
        "text": "noncomputable def liftedTorusAverage (f : PressureStream.Lift P → ℝ) (x : PressureStream.Lift P) : ℝ := PressureStream.torusAverage f (x.1, x.2.1)  -- Lift S = ℝ × (S × Plane), so x = (slow, (slow, Y)) and the Y slot is averaged out"
